185
00:12:02,780 --> 00:12:07,368
Deliver to me the soul of the pharaoh
and his companion, young Joseph Wheeler.

186
00:12:07,500 --> 00:12:09,340
The Orycalcos is with you.

187
00:12:09,720 --> 00:12:12,960
Use it correctly and
victory is yours. Yes!

188
00:12:14,200 --> 00:12:16,024
So they want to rule the world.

189
00:12:16,120 --> 00:12:17,826
We've dealt with that before.

190
00:12:18,100 --> 00:12:19,020
No, Joey.

191
00:12:19,360 --> 00:12:21,184
This time things are different.

192
00:12:21,620 --> 00:12:25,017
Yeah, they're not just talking
about wiping out all life on Earth.

193
00:12:25,100 --> 00:12:27,960
