to the ruins for answers.

219
00:13:54,700 --> 00:13:57,818
So, did you discover anything
more about these thugs?

220
00:13:58,000 --> 00:13:59,440
Well, I can't be sure,

221
00:13:59,660 --> 00:14:01,817
but based on the inscriptions I found,

222
00:14:01,900 --> 00:14:05,665
there's a good chance these fellows
are descendants of Atlantis,

223
00:14:05,880 --> 00:14:09,337
an ancient continent said
to have disappeared into

224
00:14:09,420 --> 00:14:13,420
the ocean thousands of
years ago without a trace.

225
00:14:14,060 --> 00:14:16,100
Are you sure? Professor,

226
00:14:16,360 --> 00:14:17,537
