what was left of their ancestor's city?

228
00:14:21,460 --> 00:14:23,397
They must be trying to hide something.

229
00:14:23,480 --> 00:14:28,080
Those ruins revealed the history of
Atlantis, and it's not a pleasant one.

230
00:14:28,380 --> 00:14:30,439
They must want to keep it a secret.

231
00:14:30,940 --> 00:14:33,116
How much of this history do you know?

232
00:14:33,800 --> 00:14:35,137
Thousands of years ago,

233
00:14:35,220 --> 00:14:39,749
Atlantis was home to the most advanced
civilization the world had ever known.

234
00:14:39,880 --> 00:14:42,240
It truly was a paradise on Earth,

235
00:14:42,460 --> 00:14:46,120
a land of eternal tranquility
where everyone lived in peace.

236
00:14:46,300 --> 00:14:47,460
Until one day,

237
00:14:47,640 --> 00:14:49,617
when a dreadful creature was called forth

238
00:14:49,700 --> 00:14:52,157
from the depths of the
Earth by an evil king.

239
00:14:52,240 --> 00:14:53,580
An evil king?

240
00:14:54,000 --> 00:14:54,960
Oh, no.

241
00:14:55,520 --> 00:14:56,920
